    "extract": "The M141 bunker defeat munition (BDM) is a disposable single-shot, shoulder-fired rocket launcher designed to defeat hardened structures. It is a modification of the United States Marine Corps Mk 153 shoulder-launched multipurpose assault weapon (SMAW) and is also called the SMAW-D. It was designed to fill the void in the United States Army inventory of a \"bunker buster\" weapon.",
    "extract_html": "<p>The <b>M141 bunker defeat munition</b> (<b>BDM</b>) is a disposable single-shot, shoulder-fired rocket launcher designed to defeat hardened structures. It is a modification of the United States Marine Corps Mk 153 shoulder-launched multipurpose assault weapon (SMAW) and is also called the <b>SMAW-D</b>. It was designed to fill the void in the United States Army inventory of a \"bunker buster\" weapon.</p>"
